SmartSessionEmissary::verifyClaim
├── given SmartSession mode (0x02)
│   ├── when signature is valid
│   │   └── it returns verifyClaim selector
│   ├── when session validator rejects signature
│   │   └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
│   ├── when digest is cached
│   │   └── it returns verifyClaim selector without revalidating
│   ├── when permissionId is invalid (never enabled)
│   │   └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
│   ├── when permissionId is wrong (different session)
│   │   └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
│   ├── when lockTag does not match enabled session
│   │   └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
│   ├── when account is different from enabled session
│   │   └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
│   ├── when signature is malformed
│   │   └── it reverts
│   └── given isolation tests
│       ├── it isolates claim policies per account
│       ├── it isolates claim policies per permissionId
│       └── it isolates claim policies per lockTag
├── given unknown mode (0xFF)
│   └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
└── given emissary data is empty
    └── it reverts